OL,3,ANigel Farage speech at Reform UK
OL,4,Aconference delayed over security
OL,5,Aconcerns
OL,6,
OL,7,FUndercover filming by Verbatim
OL,8,FInvestigations, aired on Thursday,
OL,9,Fshowed Farage's senior aide Dan Jukes
OL,10,Fappearing to suggest a way to evade
OL,11,Felectoral law to secure a foreign
OL,12,Fdonation of #500,000 for Reform
OL,14,FJukes and Reform's head of policy James
OL,15,FOrrs have since stepped down and the
OL,16,Fparty says it's launching an internal
OL,17,Finvestigation
OL,19,FWhat do the political donation
OL,20,Fguidelines say? BBC Verify takes a look
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/41
